.SH NAME
Assimp::Logger \- CPP-API: Abstract interface for logger implementations\&. \fBAssimp\fP provides a default implementation and uses it for almost all logging stuff ('\fBDefaultLogger\fP')\&. This class defines just basic logging behavior and is not of interest for you\&. Instead, take a look at #DefaultLogger\&.  

